{"E:\\videos\\opalhacks\\wt\\vlog\\opalhacks\\voz\\b015_t2.wav": {"text": "That's Grandma's hack, and fifty years haven't changed my mind. There's one more thing, and it's not about chickens at all. It's about your neighbors. A hen that just laid an egg sings about it, loud, for a good minute. Bawk, bawk, bawk, bay gawk, every day. It's not as loud as a rooster, but it's not quiet either, and a run full of chickens can smell in August if you don't keep it dry. So before the first complaint, Grandma's hack, Take your neighbors a dozen eggs. The first dozen your hens ever lay, you walk it over to the house next door with a little note. In fifty years I've never had a neighbor complain about my chickens, not one. I'm pretty sure it's the eggs. So here's what I wrote on that envelope for Megan and Josh, and I'll put it on the screen for you. Brooder and Starter Feed, about a hundred and fifty dollars. Coop and Run with Hardware Cloth, six to seven hundred.", "words": [{"w": " That's", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.34}, {"w": " Grandma's", "s": 0.34, "e": 0.94}, {"w": " hack,", "s": 0.94, "e": 1.54}, {"w": " and", "s": 1.54, "e": 1.64}, {"w": " fifty", "s": 1.64, "e": 2.0}, {"w": " years", "s": 2.0, "e": 2.38}, {"w": " haven't", "s": 2.38, "e": 2.72}, {"w": " changed", "s": 2.72, "e": 3.08}, {"w": " my", "s": 3.08, "e": 3.28}, {"w": " mind.", "s": 3.28, "e": 4.18}, {"w": " There's", "s": 4.22, "e": 4.44}, {"w": " one", "s": 4.44, "e": 4.64}, {"w": " more", "s": 4.64, "e": 4.86}, {"w": " thing,", "s": 4.86, "e": 5.6}, {"w": " and", "s": 5.6, "e": 5.74}, {"w": " it's", "s": 5.74, "e": 5.92}, {"w": " not", "s": 5.92, "e": 6.1}, {"w": " about", "s": 6.1, "e": 6.42}, {"w": " chickens", "s": 6.42, "e": 6.8}, {"w": " at", "s": 6.8, "e": 7.06}, {"w": " all.", "s": 7.06, "e": 7.68}, {"w": " It's", "s": 7.68, "e": 7.9}, {"w": " about", "s": 7.9, "e": 8.16}, {"w": " your", "s": 8.16, "e": 8.32}, {"w": " neighbors.", "s": 8.32, "e": 9.2}, {"w": " A", "s": 9.34, "e": 9.48}, {"w": " hen", "s": 9.4